WEBVTT

00:00:26.145 --> 00:00:32.104
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:35.437
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:35.646 --> 00:00:38.355
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:42.437
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:42.898 --> 00:00:46.080
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:50.252
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:50.564 --> 00:00:53.202
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:53.584 --> 00:00:58.129
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:00:58.369 --> 00:01:00.267
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:00.902 --> 00:01:04.766
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:05.207 --> 00:01:08.528
♪ Shocked by what appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:08.914 --> 00:01:11.960
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:12.115 --> 00:01:15.400
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:18.935
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:19.029 --> 00:01:23.113
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:25.875
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:25.876 --> 00:01:30.284
♪ That unique soul
was born to be a hero ♪

00:01:30.427 --> 00:01:33.554
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:37.479
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:40.344
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:40.345 --> 00:01:45.881
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:46.088 --> 00:01:50.179
♪ I promise ♪

00:02:32.237 --> 00:02:33.590
I used the wave detection skill
to search the area.

00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:35.949
There aren't any monsters nearby.

00:02:37.404 --> 00:02:38.177
Great.

00:02:38.556 --> 00:02:40.289
We can go to the end
of the street safely.

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:45.353
Do you feel uncomfortable?

00:02:46.562 --> 00:02:47.729
A little bit.

00:02:48.479 --> 00:02:49.355
But, it's fine.

00:02:49.729 --> 00:02:51.854
Brother Fan will bring
the medicine over soon.

00:02:53.421 --> 00:02:54.114
Keep holding on.

00:03:05.801 --> 00:03:06.895
Be aware.

00:03:07.284 --> 00:03:09.568
It's too silent.
Something will happen anytime.

00:03:12.399 --> 00:03:14.881
Mu Bai is right.
Let's be careful.

00:03:15.608 --> 00:03:18.438
This is strange. It's too silent.

00:03:18.826 --> 00:03:21.293
There aren't any monsters nearby?

00:03:22.034 --> 00:03:23.580
I heard Brother Fan said before,

00:03:24.031 --> 00:03:26.484
in the wilderness
where the monsters gather,

00:03:27.335 --> 00:03:29.855
silence is a sign of danger.

00:03:31.502 --> 00:03:32.342
Why?

00:03:32.814 --> 00:03:35.640
Wang San Pang used
his wave detection skill.

00:03:36.035 --> 00:03:37.889
There aren't any sounds of footsteps
of the monsters nearby.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.942
-Why is it dangerous?
-Be quiet.

00:04:32.893 --> 00:04:34.881
What is that?

00:04:35.149 --> 00:04:37.634
-It's scary.
-Thorn-Faced Wolf.

00:04:37.942 --> 00:04:39.409
It's a Warrior level monster.

00:04:41.312 --> 00:04:42.878
-Quick, run!
-Quick, let's run!

00:04:44.881 --> 00:04:45.775
Wait for me!

00:04:56.174 --> 00:04:57.267
Be quick, escape!

00:05:22.028 --> 00:05:23.068
Instructor Bai Yang.

00:05:24.713 --> 00:05:27.026
Instructor Bai Yang,
thank you for saving me.

00:05:28.043 --> 00:05:29.150
Lin Yuxin?

00:05:30.503 --> 00:05:31.530
Why are you here?

00:05:31.952 --> 00:05:33.005
Are you leaving the city?

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:35.750
Something happened.

00:05:36.589 --> 00:05:38.109
By the way, Instructor Bai Yang,

00:05:38.509 --> 00:05:40.376
you came from
Xuefeng Mountain's post house.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.562
Do you know the situation there now?

00:05:44.412 --> 00:05:46.118
Xuefeng Mountain's post house
was abandoned.

00:05:46.437 --> 00:05:49.604
I'm going to Sky Magic High School
to protect a student.

00:05:50.981 --> 00:05:54.204
Your Archwolf can roam freely
compared to other mages...

00:05:54.507 --> 00:05:56.801
in this dilapidated street
filled with monsters.

00:05:58.312 --> 00:06:01.562
No matter the Black Curia believe
the Sacred Spring is with me or not,

00:06:01.967 --> 00:06:04.061
I still have to gain their attention...

00:06:04.588 --> 00:06:06.535
to get more time.

00:06:07.379 --> 00:06:09.246
I'll hand the matter of searching
and protecting Mo Fan...

00:06:09.443 --> 00:06:10.603
to the military.

00:06:11.759 --> 00:06:13.666
Instructor Bai Yang, I can handle this.

00:06:14.011 --> 00:06:15.268
You should head there
as soon as possible.

00:06:15.568 --> 00:06:17.183
Okay, be careful.

00:06:30.963 --> 00:06:32.323
Xiaohou, hang on.

00:06:33.695 --> 00:06:35.962
I won't let you die just like that.

00:06:39.943 --> 00:06:41.410
Of course I like Bow City.

00:06:43.172 --> 00:06:44.638
I like everything here.

00:06:45.386 --> 00:06:47.826
But, I want to attend
a good magic university too.

00:06:48.696 --> 00:06:50.256
I want to go to a bigger city...

00:06:51.155 --> 00:06:53.555
to encounter fun and meaningful things.

00:06:55.006 --> 00:06:55.673
Of course,

00:06:56.085 --> 00:06:58.965
most importantly, I want to
keep following Brother Fan.

00:06:59.911 --> 00:07:01.378
To prevent you from leaving me behind,

00:07:01.699 --> 00:07:03.312
I'll work harder than before.

00:07:05.026 --> 00:07:06.146
In a bigger city,

00:07:06.519 --> 00:07:07.746
there are more beautiful girls.

00:07:08.498 --> 00:07:09.858
Yes.

00:07:15.315 --> 00:07:17.206
Warrior level?

00:07:17.354 --> 00:07:21.146
I thought a Warrior level monster will
be bigger than normal monsters only.

00:07:21.484 --> 00:07:23.351
I never thought the difference
would be so huge.

00:07:24.136 --> 00:07:25.815
What does Warrior level means?

00:07:26.317 --> 00:07:28.050
Just like the level one,

00:07:28.077 --> 00:07:29.680
two and three for us mages.

00:07:31.026 --> 00:07:32.773
The lowest level is Slave.

00:07:34.716 --> 00:07:36.609
Then, the Warrior level,

00:07:38.749 --> 00:07:40.776
followed by the Commander level.

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:45.370
The One-eyed Wolf Demons and Cyclops
that we met...

00:07:45.639 --> 00:07:46.799
were in the Slave level.

00:07:47.407 --> 00:07:50.469
The Warrior level
is the real nightmare killer.

00:07:50.615 --> 00:07:51.882
It's easy for it...

00:07:52.117 --> 00:07:53.624
to kill mages.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:56.866
We may be able to defeat monsters
at the Slave level.

00:07:57.813 --> 00:07:59.855
But, if we go against
a Thorn-Faced Wolf in the Warrior level,

00:08:00.381 --> 00:08:04.316
and it stares at us with its three eyes,
we wouldn't be able to move.

00:08:05.676 --> 00:08:07.930
A monster at a high level
appeared unexpectedly.

00:08:08.324 --> 00:08:10.191
What if Brother Fan meets one too?

00:08:23.124 --> 00:08:25.909
Nothing? Where is the hemostatic agent?

00:08:34.556 --> 00:08:36.089
Why is there a hole here?

00:08:58.476 --> 00:08:59.756
Isn't this the hemostatic agent?

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:02.950
Great, Zhang Xiaohou can be saved.

00:09:35.635 --> 00:09:36.674
Thorn-Faced Wolf?

00:09:36.899 --> 00:09:38.365
When I was in the Hunters' Team,

00:09:38.452 --> 00:09:40.624
I never encountered a monster
at this level.

00:09:41.446 --> 00:09:44.715
Should monsters at this level
dwell in thickly forested mountains?

00:09:45.925 --> 00:09:47.475
No wonder it was so silent.

00:09:47.562 --> 00:09:50.396
Other lower level creature
were afraid to enter this area.

00:10:25.082 --> 00:10:26.028
Continue going on.

00:10:27.211 --> 00:10:29.535
-What about Mo Fan?
-What else?

00:10:32.375 --> 00:10:34.375
Should we stay here and wait for him...

00:10:34.799 --> 00:10:35.679
or wait until we die?

00:10:37.171 --> 00:10:38.237
He said it himself,

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.881
it's over for those who die.

00:10:42.083 --> 00:10:44.550
But, those who are alive must go on.

00:10:45.874 --> 00:10:46.607
He is dead.

00:10:47.501 --> 00:10:48.874
Do we have to die along with him?

00:10:50.112 --> 00:10:50.939
Yes.

00:10:51.429 --> 00:10:52.602
With the code red,

00:10:52.629 --> 00:10:55.620
anyone can die if we don't
reach the protective barrier.

00:10:56.264 --> 00:10:57.024
Quick, let's go.

00:10:58.185 --> 00:11:00.419
Zhou Min, let's go.

00:11:00.677 --> 00:11:01.944
I think Mo Fan...

00:11:02.177 --> 00:11:04.564
wants us to reach
the protective barrier too.

00:11:04.691 --> 00:11:07.011
At least his efforts weren't in vain.

00:11:20.352 --> 00:11:22.859
Mo Fan?

00:11:23.207 --> 00:11:23.914
Brother Fan!

00:11:26.146 --> 00:11:27.808
It's Mo Fan! He's back!

00:11:27.809 --> 00:11:29.471
Mo Fan, thank goodness you didn't die.

00:11:30.152 --> 00:11:32.299
I nearly lost my life.

00:11:33.666 --> 00:11:35.959
But, it was too risky.

00:11:39.976 --> 00:11:41.869
It's worthy that I got this.

00:11:42.689 --> 00:11:43.796
You scared us.

00:11:43.997 --> 00:11:46.424
You didn't see how scary
that Bone Demon Wolf was.

00:11:48.411 --> 00:11:51.150
That creature probably thought
I was crushed into pieces by him.

00:12:04.418 --> 00:12:05.271
It doesn't hurt anymore.

00:12:07.013 --> 00:12:08.200
Luckily we had the hemostatic agent.

00:12:10.267 --> 00:12:11.080
Xiaohou.

00:12:12.806 --> 00:12:14.249
Thank you, Brother Fan.

00:12:15.036 --> 00:12:16.103
Not at all.

00:12:16.391 --> 00:12:17.764
We should depart immediately.

00:12:29.917 --> 00:12:31.170
Is this the place?

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.055
Yes, that's right.

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:36.030
Look at that way.

00:12:37.424 --> 00:12:39.264
Did the pioneer team kill it?

00:12:41.755 --> 00:12:42.576
Seems it is .

00:12:43.048 --> 00:12:44.151
Sir.

00:12:47.006 --> 00:12:48.315
It's Zhang Yinglu!

00:12:49.606 --> 00:12:51.967
Our student.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:58.989
Isn't she a member of the pioneer team?

00:12:59.559 --> 00:13:00.319
Why did she...

00:13:00.988 --> 00:13:03.919
The pioneer team is
fighting for everyone.

00:13:04.762 --> 00:13:05.922
Don't panic.

00:13:06.367 --> 00:13:09.748
If we work hard together,
we can all reach the protective barrier.

00:13:10.539 --> 00:13:11.312
Yes.

00:13:11.721 --> 00:13:14.174
Mo Fan and Mu Bai worked hard for us.

00:13:15.467 --> 00:13:16.681
We can't give up.

00:13:17.152 --> 00:13:17.872
Yes.

00:13:18.837 --> 00:13:19.597
Also,

00:13:20.844 --> 00:13:23.773
let's bring her along with us.

00:14:10.746 --> 00:14:13.292
Look, we can see the light
of the protective barrier.

00:14:14.399 --> 00:14:15.533
Hang on a bit more, everyone.

00:14:15.992 --> 00:14:17.217
The closer we are
to the protective barrier,

00:14:17.484 --> 00:14:18.950
the safer our surroundings are.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.570
We just need to cross the moat in front.

00:14:40.977 --> 00:14:41.871
Is that...

00:14:44.167 --> 00:14:45.527
Everyone, be careful.

00:14:48.378 --> 00:14:49.325
Instructor Bai Yang?

00:14:49.923 --> 00:14:51.416
Isn't that Instructor Bai Yang?

00:14:51.961 --> 00:14:54.864
Great. We met someone
from the military here.

00:14:57.253 --> 00:14:58.573
Why are you here?

00:14:59.032 --> 00:15:00.632
Didn't you evacuate at once?

00:15:01.588 --> 00:15:05.599
The monsters suddenly attacked the city.
There are too many people in the school.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.067
We didn't evacuate at once.

00:15:07.737 --> 00:15:10.057
The rest of them are 1 km behind us.

00:15:10.735 --> 00:15:14.071
They are following our footsteps
to the protective barrier.

00:15:14.832 --> 00:15:17.925
Sir, you have no idea how dangerous
it was on the way here.

00:15:18.002 --> 00:15:19.882
You'll bring us to
the protective barrier, right?

00:15:22.362 --> 00:15:23.175
Mo Fan?

00:15:26.053 --> 00:15:27.200
I was looking for you.

00:15:28.815 --> 00:15:29.615
Me?

00:15:31.021 --> 00:15:31.807
Yes.

00:15:33.146 --> 00:15:36.180
The Sacred Spring is with you, right?
Give it to me.

00:15:36.932 --> 00:15:38.652
It's very important.

00:15:38.898 --> 00:15:40.378
If it falls into the hands
of the Black Curia,

00:15:40.589 --> 00:15:41.962
the Bow City will be doomed.

00:15:42.639 --> 00:15:44.149
Mo Fan, quick.

00:15:44.323 --> 00:15:45.966
Hand the Sacred Spring
to Instructor Bai Yang.

00:15:46.501 --> 00:15:47.728
It's safer in his hands.

00:15:52.335 --> 00:15:53.548
It's safe with me too.

00:15:54.833 --> 00:15:56.525
I'll hand it to Zhan Kong myself.

00:16:00.754 --> 00:16:02.887
Instructor Bai Yang,
please lead the way.

00:16:05.279 --> 00:16:07.815
You're right.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:14.350
If that's the case...

00:16:17.397 --> 00:16:18.877
Then, you can die!

00:16:38.503 --> 00:16:40.878
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:16:41.581 --> 00:16:44.991
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:16:45.261 --> 00:16:48.312
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:16:48.953 --> 00:16:50.433
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:16:50.834 --> 00:16:52.727
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:16:53.341 --> 00:16:56.387
♪ Dreamt that
we will not wander anymore ♪

00:16:56.719 --> 00:17:00.644
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:02.117 --> 00:17:06.042
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:07.035 --> 00:17:11.982
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:13.043 --> 00:17:16.304
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:16.616 --> 00:17:19.470
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:19.737 --> 00:17:22.062
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:22.205 --> 00:17:25.113
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:25.438 --> 00:17:28.160
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:28.295 --> 00:17:31.712
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:17:32.038 --> 00:17:34.007
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:17:34.579 --> 00:17:37.676
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:17:38.221 --> 00:17:42.060
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:17:42.648 --> 00:17:48.885
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
